# SHOTLIST v3 2026-11-06 (shootGallery 9.0, director pass by Opus kept in part; owner chose the ponytail 2026-11-06). Supersedes v2 of 2026-10-27. Scenario bodies rewritten from v3 (2026-11-06).
# Story: the keeper's evening walk. Nelim (NSB, only colonist) crosses her land at dusk, feeds and settles the herd of the dry plains, species by species; the fire is lit at 18:00 and she sits by it at 19:00 (the loop).
# Time: start 18 h, cumulative waits 60, 893, 1727, 2560 ticks = 18:00, 18:20, 18:40, 19:00, Clear. Outfit continuity: teal Apparel_CollarShirt (24,74,84), Apparel_Pants (16,52,60), canon hair Roo_HD_Hair_Highpony (ponytail), own face, smile except scene 3.
# Framing rule (v3): the camera takes the closest zoom, the frame is a CROP of the 1920x1080 capture, never below 1280x720 (no upscaling beyond 1.5x). Nelim must be 20 px or more per cell tall so her face reads at 268 px: she faces South where the job allows. Animals at least 2 cells apart, three hues of clearly different brightness (pale, mid, dark).
# 1 WIDE opener, bare-clearing 18:00 (v3.1 2026-11-06, after 09cb: Nelim absent, 2 of 3 mammoths, coats alike). Crop x184-204, z146-157 (20x11.25, 96 px per cell). 5 WoodLog spawned at (186,149) (v3 spawned none, so the haul did nothing); Nelim forced to haul them to (192,152), paused mid-stride about 3 cells before the fire, a log in her hands, walking East toward it (profile, face visible); Campfire (193,152) pre-lit, centre third; TorchLamp (203,148) lit; 10 Hay at (199,153); 3 WoollyMammoth, 3 coats picked by hue and brightness and checked at 268 px (swap a coat that blurs): coat-1 ingests Hay at (199,153), coat-2 walks South at (202,150) (front view), coat-3 stands at (197,150) West of the hay, inside the crop (v3 had it at (204,155), out of frame). Instant: the last log for the fire. Caption: "She brings wood to the fire." est 4.5; risk: the haul must be visible and Nelim in frame (check at capture).
# 2 MEDIUM, water-garden west bank 18:20 (cells x143-158 z168-176, avoid (149,173) and (150,173)). v3.1: no haul or drop job (09cb-era a062: she ended cut by the bottom edge still holding the meat). Crop x143-163, z167-178 (20x11). Meat_Muffalo spawned at (150,170); a second Meat_Muffalo hauled by Nelim from (152,175) toward the first, paused 30 to 40 ticks after the start about 2 cells before it, the meat in her hands, facing the otters (North-West), at least 2 cells above the bottom of the crop (v3.1b: a gesture instead of standing, Opus); 3 lit TorchLamp (147,168), (153,168), (155,172) to lift the murk, water edge in the middle band; 3 Enhydriodon, 3 hues in order: coat-1 eats the meat, coat-2 walks to it, coat-3 lies full at the right third; Plant_Daylily x4 fully grown along the bottom row (146..156,175). Instant: the otters have reached the meat she set down. Caption: "She feeds the otters." est 4.5; risk: dark water side, bank cells.
# 3 MEDIUM-TIGHT, bare-clearing 18:40. Crop x190-210, z147-158 (20x11, 96 px per cell; v3 z145-156 let Nelim end at the top edge). 3 Pulmonoscorpius, 3 hues (pale, mid, dark), eat Meat_Muffalo at (199,152) from 3 sides, 2 cells apart, about 60 percent of the frame; Nelim hauls a second Meat_Muffalo from (195,156) toward the scorpions meat at (199,152), paused 30 to 40 ticks after the start near (197,155) (lower-left, the old forced walk to a free cell sent her north: the haul target is fixed), the meat in her hands, facing North-East toward them (face in three-quarter view), expression normal (wary, written: the only non-smile of the series); TorchLamp (197,149); two spare WoodLog at (191,156) tie the place to shot 1. Instant: just after she threw the meat. Caption: "She feeds the scorpions." est 4.5; risk: scorpion pause, Nelim in frame (check at capture).
# 4 MEDIUM-WIDE closer, bare-clearing 19:00 night. Crop x186-208, z146-158 (22x12). Campfire (193,152) pre-lit, 2 TorchLamp (190,148) and (190,156), Stool (191,153); Nelim placed on the Stool by the step (fixed 2aa6f93, green 65b3: she stands on the seat cell, facing the fire), smile; 3 Chalicotherium, 3 coats (-1, 1, 4): two lying, one walking to the fire, 2 cells apart. Instant: the herd settles. Caption: "She sits by the fire while the herd settles." est 4.5; risk: Stool seat pose reads as standing.
# 5 to 8 MORNING COUNT (v3.3, rule 5, owner 2026-11-06 "c'est toi qui voit, réalisatrice"; Opus pass: 8 animals blur at 268 px, so 4 shots of 5 to 6, balanced sizes, one giant each). Next morning, Clear, 06:30, 07:30, 08:30, 09:30; same outfit (the next day of the same tour, kept on purpose), smile, empty-handed except the gesture. Crop 24x13.5 cells (80 px per cell, 16:9). ONE coat per animal chosen for contrast with the ground (the other coats of each animal are not drawn: 67 coats cannot read at 268 px, written here); animals 2 to 3 cells apart, varied jobs, none lined up; 3 foreground animals readable, the rest background, half-cropped at the edges allowed. 5 enclosure-north (x144-187 z224-245) 06:30 dawn, crop x156-180 z230-243.5: TorchLamp lit (159,238) warm key light, Hay x10 centre (168,236); Nelim lower-left (160,238) forced to walk toward the hay, paused 30 ticks, back three-quarter to camera; foreground Deinotherium (Ingest hay), Platybelodon (walks), Uintatherium (stands South, front view); background Macrauchenia, Castoroides, Josephoartigasia lying. "She counts the great browsers." 6 exhibition-zone (orange carpet, centre (218,166)) 07:30, crop on the carpet edge, half carpet half grass: dark or grey coats on the carpet, warm coats on the grass; Plant_Daylily x3 on the edge; Nelim hauls Hay (item in her hands), paused mid-stride; foreground Paraceratherium, Diprotodon, Doedicurus; background Gomphotaria, Procoptodon, Daeodon. "She counts the strange grazers." 7 rice-paddy (brown ground, forest edge, around (230,122)) 08:30: pale or dark coats only (no tawny), WoodLog pile on the east side marks the forest edge; Nelim hauls Meat_Muffalo, paused 2 cells from Smilodon (Ingest it); Megalania and Purussaurus forced to lie, Titanis walks, Andrewsarchus stands back; foreground Smilodon, Titanis, Megalania. "She counts the hunters." 8 calm-zone (cream carpet, centre (200,187)) 09:30, closing image: Elasmotherium, Zygolophodon, Sivatherium, Dinocrocuta, Arthropleura; Nelim stands at the centre with the herd around, smiling (written), just finished the count; 2 TorchLamp unlit, Plant_Daylily x3. "The count is done." Cells and positions of 6 to 8 are set when their bodies are written; est 4; risks: crowd and overlap, predators near prey (forced Wait or lie), dark dawn in 5.
# Kept from the director pass: Nelim big by crop and facing South, 3 mammoth coats, empty hands in scene 2 and a second lamp, crop floor 1280x720 (his 10 to 12 cell crops refused: upscaling), Nelim 2 cells SW in scene 3, fire loop 1 to 4, one caption per image, animal spacing and brightness. Refused: Table + forced Ingest in scene 4 (unproven, the Stool step is green), moving Nelim right in scene 4, changing season for light.
# Expression: smile on default scenes (own face, MouthSmile + LidCheerful, then normal+blink last; check on the capture), normal in scene 3 (wary). Plants_YellowTallGrass dropped (invisible). Gesture obtained by forced jobs, then "I advance the paused game by exactly N ticks" (30 to 60), then "time is paused for the capture".
# Steps used: the places, the face and the cleaning are Nelim's Sanctuary: steps; the jobs, the lying and sitting poses, the decor, the framing and the
# face are Nelim's Pickle Tools: steps; the spawn and coat steps are CoatSteps. The crop is a tool step after the run (Art/Gallery-clean).
# Each scenario is @review: a green run proves a picture was taken, not that it is worth uploading. The session opens every capture.
# Run: Submit-PickleRun.ps1 -Mod ColorfulCoatsMegafaunaRenew -DepMap wsl-deps.gallery.map -Filter '@gallery'. Subtitles: PUBLICATION.md, "Gallery subtitles".
